7
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.266
Vayamos allí.

8
00:00:22.066 --> 00:00:22.966
Vamos.

9
00:00:36.633 --> 00:00:37.366
abuelo,

10
00:00:37.866 --> 00:00:39.100
